🚩Meta's India content blocks surge 13,000% as govt takedown orders rise

(Any criticism of Govt  in Social Media  is unwelcome !! Globally such restrictions have  declined by 2.7% & In our Mother of Democracy they have gone up by mind boggling  13,000% in a span of 6 months. Blockage , suppression, Criminalization of criticism,dissent has become order of the day )

@THE NUMBER of content restrictions imposed by social media giant Meta on Facebook and Instagram in India under local laws by government, law enforcement agencies, and courts, surged by more than 13,000% between January and June 2026, with the company re-stricting access to 54.39 lakh pieces of content and accounts, compared with around 41,400 in the preceding six months.

@An analysis of Meta's trans-parency data by The Indian Ex-press shows that while the number of content restrictions imposed by the company globally declined by 2.7% during January-June 2026 compared with the preceding six months, such restrictions in India in-creased more than 131-fold.

@Separately, Google received 4,006 content takedown requests from Indian government authorities and courts between January and June 2026, an in-crease of more than 61% from 2,483 in the preceding six months

